    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.exothermichearth.tooltip=Machine Type: §eBlast Furnace, ExH, MEBF, MBF§r\n§6256§7 Parallels\n§b-5%§7 EU Usage per §c900K§7 above the recipe requirement\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nIncreases Heat by §c100K§7 for every §fVoltage§7 tier past §bMV\nEvery §c1800K§7 over the recipe requirement grants 1 §dPerfect Overclock\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nWhile active, the machine will heat up and multiply its parallels up to §62x\nTakes §d30 minutes§7 of constant running to reach maximum multiplier\nWhile not running, the machine will rapidly cooldown\nOptionally supply §c250 mB§7/s of §6Pyrotheum§7 to speed up heating by §c6x\nThe drain rate of §6Pyrotheum§7 will increase §dlinearly§7 with the parallel multiplier\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§aSupports Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\n§2§nUV§7-tier §fGlass§7 required for Laser Hatches\nEnergy Hatch limited by §fGlass§7 Tier\nThis machine can run recipes regardless of tier, if given enough energy\n§7§5102,400§7 Pollution per second\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§o§4Never one...\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nStructure by: §aGregTech Odyssey§r§7\n旧译：\n机器类型：§e高炉，ExH、MEBF、MBF§r\n并行：§6256§7\n功率系数：炉温每超出配方要求§c900K§7，降低§b5%§7\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§f电压§7等级每超出§bMV§7一级，热量增加§c100K§7\n每超出配方要求温度§c1800K§7，将一次有损超频变为§d无损超频\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n启动时，机器将开始升温，并逐步将并行增幅提升至§62倍§7\n需持续运行§d30分钟§7方能达到最大增幅\n若停止运行，机器将迅速恢复至常温状态\n当供给§c250mB/s§6烈焰之炽焱§7时，以§c六倍速§7加速升温（可选）\n§6烈焰之炽焱§7的消耗速率会随并行增幅呈§d线性增长§7\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§a支持多A能源仓与激光仓！\n激光仓需要§2§nUV§7等级的§f玻璃§7\n能源仓上限受限于§f玻璃§7等级\n只要有足够的能量，这台机器能运行任何等级的配方\n每秒产生§5102400§7点污染\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§o§4执子之魂...\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n按住§l[LSHIFT]§r§7显示结构指导\n结构作者：§a格雷科技 · 新征程（GregTech Odyssey）§r§7
